{54}{I've had my fill of your pompous babblings.}{}{5}{lc2 1}{}{co, fl 238}
{56}{Well, it seems we are at a crossroads, my friend.  We, the Schuyler family, have been in business for more than 400 years.  Never once in all that time have we betrayed the trust of a customer.  And yet here you are, and so much you've seen!}{Well, it seems we are at a crossroads, my friend.  We, the Schuyler family, have been in business for more than 400 years.  Never once in all that time have we betrayed the trust of a customer.  And yet here you are, and so much you've seen!}{}{}{}{lc1 3}
