{62}{Magnus and I offer a permanent solution for your perversity.}{}{5}{lc2 1, pa 6411}{}{co, fl 238}
{63}{I really must be moving along...}{}{5}{}{146}{}
{65}{I suppose it does no harm in telling you now. I am Winston Schuyler, and these are my brothers, Edward and Niles.  The Schuyler name is an old name...one of the oldest families in all of Arcanum...we've traced our blood lines back to the Age of Legends and further.  And always, from the very beginning, we have practiced the darker arts...}{I suppose it does no harm in telling you now. I am Winston Schuyler, and these are my brothers, Edward and Niles.  The Schuyler name is an old name...one of the oldest families in all of Arcanum...we've traced our blood lines back to the Age of Legends and further.  And always, from the very beginning, we have practiced the darker arts...}{}{}{}{lc1 4}
