{74}{Necromancy, my curious friend.  Conjurings of the spirits, phantasmal speaking, the animation of the incurably dead.  The Schuylers are a family who spend their time in the twilight lands, cowled in death and shadow...}{Necromancy, my curious friend.  Conjurings of the spirits, phantasmal speaking, the animation of the incurably dead.  The Schuylers are a family who spend their time in the twilight lands, cowled in death and shadow...}{}{}{}{lc1 5, lf8 1}
