{83}{Yes.  It's not as cruel as you might think...these bodies are long past usefulness to anyone.  They are spiritless and properly good for digging.  And with the bounty we've discovered here in this dwarven tomb, they've been extremely useful...}{Yes.  It's not as cruel as you might think...these bodies are long past usefulness to anyone.  They are spiritless and good for digging.  And with the bounty we've discovered here in this dwarven tomb, they are extremely useful...}{}{}{}{lc1 6}
