{90}{Yes...we discovered the tomb more than 150 years ago, before Tarant had become such a great city.  And so our family left their home in old Caladon, and moved here.  We weren't sad to leave there...some of the locals had begun to become suspicious of our activities.}{Yes...we discovered the tomb more than 150 years ago, before Tarant had become such a great city.  And so our family left their home in old Caladon, and moved here.  We weren't sad to leave there...some of the locals had begun to become suspicious of our activities.}{}{}{}{lc1 7}
{91}{No offense, but I can see why they might be a little leery...}{}{5}{}{94}{}
