{94}{Sadly, I can see your point.  The world, for ones such as we, is becoming smaller.  So few people remember the old ways, when magic was a part of everything and everyone. There was a time when we were legitimate businessmen, and no one blinked an eye at our operations...}{Sadly, I can see your point.  The world, for ones such as we, is becoming smaller.  So few people remember the old ways, when magic was a part of everything and everyone. There was a time when we were legitimate businessmen, and no one blinked an eye at our operations...}{}{}{}{lc1 8}
